  "title": "Hy3 is one of the newest open-source reasoning models pushing the limits of efficient AI.",
  "description": "Hy3 is one of the newest open-source reasoning models pushing the limits of efficient AI.\n\nInstead of reasoning deeply for every prompt, it dynamically switches between fast and slow thinking, using extra compute only when it's actually needed. The result is faster responses, lower costs, and strong performance across coding, research, and agent workflows.\n\nIt's built to integrate with tools like Claude Code and Cursor, and you can even try its API for free for a limited time.\n\nIf you're looking for the next open-source model to add to your AI stack, Hy3 is definitely worth watching.\n\n#opensource #ai #llm #claudecode #cursor #genai",
